msgid ""
"How customer data is encrypted and how users can delete their personal data."
msgstr ""
"Cara data pelanggan dienkripsi dan cara pengguna bisa menghapus data pribadi"
" mereka."

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Securing your data"
msgstr "Mengamankan datamu"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Securing your data {#securing-your-data}"
msgstr "Mengamankan datamu {#securing-your-data}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To ensure that you can securely manage your data when you use IBM "
"Quantum&reg; Platform, it is important to know exactly what data is stored "
"and encrypted and how you can delete any stored data.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk memastikan kamu bisa mengelola datamu dengan aman saat menggunakan IBM"
" Quantum&reg; Platform, penting untuk mengetahui data apa saja yang disimpan"
" dan dienkripsi, serta bagaimana cara menghapus data yang tersimpan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Protecting your sensitive data {#protecting-your-sensitive-data}"
msgstr "Melindungi data sensitifmu {#protecting-your-sensitive-data}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The data that you store in IBM Cloud&reg; is encrypted at rest by using a "
"randomly generated key.\n"
msgstr ""
"Data yang kamu simpan di IBM Cloud&reg; dienkripsi saat tidak aktif "
"menggunakan kunci yang dibuat secara acak.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Deleting your data {#deleting-your-data}"
msgstr "Menghapus datamu {#deleting-your-data}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Deleting a service instance removes all of the content associated with that "
"instance, such as your jobs, results, parameters, and programs. To delete an"
" instance, from the [Instances "
"page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances), find the instance you want "
"to remove, click its overflow menu, then click **Delete**. You will be asked"
" to confirm the deletion.\n"
msgstr ""
"Menghapus instansi layanan akan menghapus semua konten yang terkait dengan "
"instansi tersebut, seperti job, hasil, parameter, dan program. Untuk "
"menghapus instansi, dari [halaman "
"Instances,](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) temukan instansi yang "
"ingin dihapus, klik menu overflow-nya, lalu klik **Delete**. Kamu akan "
"diminta untuk mengonfirmasi penghapusan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you have a Manager role, you can also delete an individual job and its "
"data. See more about access policies, groups, and roles in the "
"[documentation](/guides/access-groups).\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika kamu memiliki peran Manager, kamu juga bisa menghapus job individual "
"beserta datanya. Lihat selengkapnya tentang kebijakan akses, grup, dan peran"
" di [dokumentasi](/guides/access-groups).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Data retention policy {#data-retention-policy}"
msgstr "Kebijakan retensi data {#data-retention-policy}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM will retain your (undeleted) data for three years while you are a "
"current user of the service. To find information about how long data is "
"retained by IBM after you stop using the service, see the [Qiskit Runtime "
"data "
"sheet](https://www.ibm.com/support/customer/csol/terms/?id=BB6EE1D06BDE11EBA199CCFE56FA6D9D),"
" found on the IBM Terms site.\n"
msgstr ""
"IBM akan menyimpan datamu (yang belum dihapus) selama tiga tahun selama kamu"
" masih menjadi pengguna aktif layanan ini. Untuk mengetahui informasi "
"tentang berapa lama data disimpan oleh IBM setelah kamu berhenti menggunakan"
" layanan, lihat [Qiskit Runtime data "
"sheet](https://www.ibm.com/support/customer/csol/terms/?id=BB6EE1D06BDE11EBA199CCFE56FA6D9D),"
" yang tersedia di situs IBM Terms.\n"
